    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="0d157fbc-9feb-524c-a24f-9a1df6379e1d" activityNameId="8bb0c06e-a749-527a-a331-a4807f9405e6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">ICE</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: ICE
The life span of the train  is assumed to be 25 years. The yearly kilometric performance is 400'000 km resulting in a life time performance of  10’000’000 vkm. ;
Synonyms: (Inter City Express); 
UUID: 9ad11933-2b25-3a00-a4c8-7fc646a1f022
This inventory calls processes of material production, representing the material composition of a ICE. For manufacturing, electricity and light oil burned in industrial furnace are included. For the transportation of materials standard distance are applied.
Location: Manufacturing data represents a train produced in Germany.
Technology: Mix of ICE I (40%) and ICE 2 (60%)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: The data of the material composition and energy consumption is based on  literature studies. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9ad11933-2b25-3a00-a4c8-7fc646a1f022.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="948c6fdb-25b0-54ae-bf5c-e320176f724c" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
